  "notes": [
    "FoC debug build, Coruscant quick load, seed 12345, tick 0 at frame 345, 30 logical ticks/s; fog revealed to both players and player AI suspended.",
    "The Empire level-1 station (Skirmish_Empire_Star_Base_1) is spawned at (6500,-2075,0) facing +X (bearing 0), the same open-space point used for the Rebel-station cases. One invulnerable, hold_fire Nebulon-B frigate (owner rebel, hostile to the empire shooter) is spawned 700 units out at bearing 150 degrees (positive to port) from the station's facing (docs/behaviour/space-weapon-fire.md M2 arc table).",
    "Neither laser reaches this bearing (HP_Empire_Station_One_01 reaches -180..0, HP_Empire_Station_One_02 reaches -60..120); only the 360 x 360 concussion missile battery HP_Empire_Station_One_00 does, because it fires in every direction.",
    "No order and no hold_position on the station or the target; an idle unit keeps its heading (A-05). A single target avoids the multi-candidate opportunity-scan tie (R-08/R-09) that a shared multi-target scenario would confound.",
    "Record-only: which hardpoints fire, not when; shot timing follows retail random recharge."
  ],
